    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Space Rocks in Space</strong> is a classic arcade game re-imagined and re-invigorated. Blast into the ultimate space adventure and pilot your ship through chaotic asteroid fields, hostile UFO attacks, and deadly missile storms. Unlock new worlds\u2014from the arctic expanse of Earth to the swirling depths of a blackhole and the ever-changing expanse of a writhing nebula.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Modes:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic:</strong> Chase high scores as you blast through relentless waves of space debris.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>War:</strong> Go head-to-head with swarms of UFOs in intense dogfights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Super:</strong> Defend Earth from apocalyptic meteor showers and alien invaders.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and fully customize a fleet of ships to make them your own.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer visually stunning worlds that are constantly changing. The possibilities are infinite.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master fast-paced, adrenaline-fueled gameplay with a retro-inspired twist.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Space Rocks in Space</strong> is a classic arcade game re-imagined and re-invigorated. Blast into the ultimate space adventure and pilot your ship through chaotic asteroid fields, hostile UFO attacks, and deadly missile storms. Unlock new worlds\u2014from the arctic expanse of Earth to the swirling depths of a blackhole and the ever-changing expanse of a writhing nebula.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Modes:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic:</strong> Chase high scores as you blast through relentless waves of space debris.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>War:</strong> Go head-to-head with swarms of UFOs in intense dogfights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Super:</strong> Defend Earth from apocalyptic meteor showers and alien invaders.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and fully customize a fleet of ships to make them your own.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer visually stunning worlds that are constantly changing. The possibilities are infinite.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master fast-paced, adrenaline-fueled gameplay with a retro-inspired twist.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Blast into the chaos of Space Rocks in Space, the ultimate 3D space flight adventure. Pilot customizable ships, explore stunning worlds, and battle through asteroid storms, UFO attacks and endless missiles barrages in this retro arcade odyssey.",
